     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap eclaire-study-status-concept-map</b></p><a name=\"eclaire-study-status-concept-map\"> </a><a name=\"hceclaire-study-status-concept-map\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-eclaire-study-status-vs.html\">Value Set Statut Eclaire de l'essai</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/valueset-research-study-status.html\">ResearchStudyStatus</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-eclaire-study-status-code-system.html\">Définition des statuts de l'essai utilisés dans la base de données ECLAIRE</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-research-study-status.html\">ResearchStudyStatus</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>a-demarrer (A démarrer)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>approved</td></tr><tr><td>en-cours</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>active</td></tr><tr><td>suspendue</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>temporarily-closed-to-accrual</td></tr><tr><td>suspendue</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>temporarily-closed-to-accrual-and-intervention</td></tr><tr><td>prorogee (Prorogée)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>approved</td></tr><tr><td>expiree (Expirée)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to